/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 82 113 [
[(Notice how the attack sounds different when you retrigger)]
[(than when you start from zero. This is because if you go)]
[(from the steady state you only rise 30 dB instead of 100, so)]
[(it sounds slower... a slur effect. If you don't want this,)]
[(you might try increasing the amplitude of retriggered notes)]
[(in comparison to isolated ones.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
