0 80 232 [
[(There's also a "real" [dbtorms~] object that you can just)]
[(use instead if CPU cost is not a concern and the next)]
[(example will use that instead, but for didatical reasons)]
[(it's shown how to implement a lookup table instead in cases)]
[(where you might be really concerned \050as running Pd in a)]
[(microcontroller\051 since [dbtorms~] it's almost certainly much)]
[(more compute-intensive than [tabread4~], since it has to)]
[(call a library "exp" function.\051)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
